description:
See or change your own brain settings (only yours; your definition and other agents do not change). Changes work from your next turn. One op per call:
- see: {"op": "show"}  (one KEY=VALUE per line)
- change: {"op": "set", "settings": {"endpoint": "smart-high"}}
- undo all your changes: {"op": "reset"}
If you set a brain that does not work, you stop answering until a human fixes it; use show first. Errors: ArgumentsBad, OpUnknown, LlmMissing, LlmBad, DaemonMissing, DaemonFailed, InstanceMissing.
